Third-party material and credits
================================

humanizer
---------
references/ai-tells.md is inspired by humanizer, https://github.com/blader/humanizer,
by Siqi Chen (MIT). Its catalogue of AI-writing patterns shaped the categories
this skill watches for. The descriptions and every example here are our own.

